{"seq":1,"slug":"inventory-carrying-cost-capital","title":"库存资金占用与持有成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/capital-attribution/inventory-carrying-cost-capital","wordCount":1857,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"库存资金占用与持有成本\">库存资金占用与持有成本</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>库存是压在仓库里的现金，这句话的工程含义是：<strong>每一件在库商品都是一笔零收益的投资</strong>，而它的成本远不止仓储费。持有成本的标准构成见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holding_cost\">Holding cost</a>：该来源把持有成本定义为「the total cost of holding inventory」，并拆成四类——资本成本（「financial costs such as opportunity cost」）、仓储成本（「rent, utilities and salaries」）、服务成本（库存管理、保险等人工）、以及库存风险成本（「perishability, shrinkage, and insurance」，含贬值与呆滞）。该来源给出的经验区间是「Carrying costs typically range between 20 and 30% of a company&#39;s inventory value」。</p>\n<p>这个 20%–30% 的区间是本节最重要的工程常数。它意味着<strong>一件成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>的货压一年，真实消耗是</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 的货压一年，真实消耗是</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的货压一年，真实消耗是</span></span></span></span></span>2 到 $3</strong>，而不是仓租那几毛钱。如果 EOQ 或补货模型里用的持有成本率只算了仓租（常见 3%–5%），最优批量会偏大数倍，这正是 <a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/safety-stock-excess-stockout\">超储</a> 的结构性来源。</p>\n<p>资金占用还要放到现金循环里看。按 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cash_conversion_cycle\">Cash conversion cycle</a>，「CCC (in days) = Inventory conversion period + Receivables conversion period – Payables conversion period」，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CCC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>DIO</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>DSO</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>DPO</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CCC} = \\text{DIO} + \\text{DSO} - \\text{DPO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CCC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DIO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DSO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPO</span></span></span></span></span></span>。跨境场景里 DIO 常因海运拉长到 90–120 天，DPO 因供应商账期也只有 30–60 天，CCC 天然比国内高一截——这意味着同样的库存金额，跨境卖家占用的资金周期更长，资金成本必须按实际 CCC 而不是按记账周期折算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[库存成本价值] --&gt; B[资本成本&lt;br/&gt;机会成本/WACC]&#10;  A --&gt; C[仓储成本&lt;br/&gt;租金/水电/人工]&#10;  A --&gt; D[服务成本&lt;br/&gt;保险/系统/盘点]&#10;  A --&gt; E[风险成本&lt;br/&gt;贬值/破损/过期]&#10;  B --&gt; F[合计持有成本率&lt;br/&gt;20-30%/年]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[单位持有成本 = 单位成本 × 费率 × 持有天数/365]&#10;  G --&gt; H[资金占用报表]&#10;  G --&gt; I[EOQ 的 h 参数]&#10;  G --&gt; J[呆滞的真实代价&lt;br/&gt;呆滞金额 × 费率]\">graph TD\n  A[库存成本价值] --&gt; B[资本成本&lt;br/&gt;机会成本/WACC]\n  A --&gt; C[仓储成本&lt;br/&gt;租金/水电/人工]\n  A --&gt; D[服务成本&lt;br/&gt;保险/系统/盘点]\n  A --&gt; E[风险成本&lt;br/&gt;贬值/破损/过期]\n  B --&gt; F[合计持有成本率&lt;br/&gt;20-30%/年]\n  C --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[单位持有成本 = 单位成本 × 费率 × 持有天数/365]\n  G --&gt; H[资金占用报表]\n  G --&gt; I[EOQ 的 h 参数]\n  G --&gt; J[呆滞的真实代价&lt;br/&gt;呆滞金额 × 费率]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本类目</th>\n<th>典型年化费率</th>\n<th>计算基数</th>\n<th>可归因到 SKU？</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资本成本（WACC/机会成本）</td>\n<td>6%–12%</td>\n<td>落地成本</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>跨境可按币种与账期微调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓储（租金、水电）</td>\n<td>4%–8%</td>\n<td>体积或托盘位</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>宜按体积分摊而非金额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓储人工与设备</td>\n<td>3%–6%</td>\n<td>出库量或库位数</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>与作业量相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险</td>\n<td>0.5%–1.5%</td>\n<td>货值</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>按保单费率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>损耗与破损</td>\n<td>1%–3%</td>\n<td>货值</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>用历史报废率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贬值与过期</td>\n<td>3%–10%</td>\n<td>货值</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>品类差异极大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台长期仓储附加费</td>\n<td>视政策</td>\n<td>存放时长分档</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>超期后阶梯上升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"持有成本率的测算与分配\">持有成本率的测算与分配</h2><h3 id=\"资本成本不能用账面利率\">资本成本不能用账面利率</h3><p>资本成本的机会成本口径应使用企业的 <strong>WACC 或内部资金成本率</strong>，而不是银行贷款利率。理由很直接：库存占用的资金本可以投入营销、研发或理财，其替代收益才是真实成本。跨境还有一层：如果库存以美元计价、资金以人民币成本获得，中间存在汇率敞口，理论上应加上远期贴水成本。工程上不追求精确到基点，但<strong>必须避免用 0</strong>——把资本成本记为零是库存分析里最常见也最贵的错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分摊基数的选择\">分摊基数的选择</h3><p>持有成本的分摊基数不应统一用「金额」。仓储空间按<strong>体积</strong>分摊更公平（轻抛货占位不占钱），人工按<strong>出库行数</strong>分摊更公平，资本与保险按<strong>金额</strong>分摊。混用单一基数会让某类 SKU 被系统性高估或低估——典型的后果是「高值小体积」的电子产品被高估仓储成本，被错误地优先清仓。</p>\n<h3 id=\"费率的粒度\">费率的粒度</h3><p>费率应做到<strong>品类级</strong>，不必做到 SKU 级。品类内贬值率、仓储形态、损耗率相近；SKU 级的精度提升不足以补偿维护成本。但<strong>跨境必须有国家/区域维度</strong>，因为关税、仓储费、长期仓储附加费的政策差异是国家级的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;carrying_cost_policy&quot;: &quot;v2026.09&quot;,&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;region&quot;: &quot;EU&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rates&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;capital&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;landed_cost&quot;, &quot;annual_rate&quot;: 0.09 },&#10;    &quot;storage_space&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;cbm&quot;, &quot;annual_rate_per_cbm&quot;: 78.0 },&#10;    &quot;storage_labor&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;outbound_lines&quot;, &quot;rate_per_line&quot;: 0.42 },&#10;    &quot;insurance&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;landed_cost&quot;, &quot;annual_rate&quot;: 0.008 },&#10;    &quot;shrinkage&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;landed_cost&quot;, &quot;annual_rate&quot;: 0.015 },&#10;    &quot;depreciation&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;landed_cost&quot;,&#10;      &quot;annual_rate_by_category&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;apparel&quot;: 0.18,&#10;        &quot;consumer_electronics&quot;: 0.12,&#10;        &quot;home_goods&quot;: 0.08,&#10;        &quot;books&quot;: 0.04&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;aging_multiplier&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;age_days_over&quot;: 0, &quot;factor&quot;: 1.0 },&#10;    { &quot;age_days_over&quot;: 180, &quot;factor&quot;: 1.35 },&#10;    { &quot;age_days_over&quot;: 365, &quot;factor&quot;: 1.8 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;notes&quot;: &quot;aging_multiplier applies to depreciation only; long-storage surcharges are billed separately by platform&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"carrying_cost_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v2026.09\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"region\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"capital\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"landed_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"annual_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.09</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"storage_space\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cbm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"annual_rate_per_cbm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">78.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"storage_labor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"outbound_lines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate_per_line\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"insurance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"landed_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"annual_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.008</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"shrinkage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"landed_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"annual_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.015</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"depreciation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"landed_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"annual_rate_by_category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"apparel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"consumer_electronics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"home_goods\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.08</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"books\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.04</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aging_multiplier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"age_days_over\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"age_days_over\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">180</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"age_days_over\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">365</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"notes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aging_multiplier applies to depreciation only; long-storage surcharges are billed separately by platform\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>aging_multiplier</code> 是这套策略里最有用的一处设计：它把「越久越贵」的非线性显式表达出来，让 365 天以上的库存持有成本接近翻倍。这直接支撑 <a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/slowmoving-deadstock-rule-alert\">呆滞识别</a> 的紧迫性论证——不是「呆滞占地方」，而是「呆滞每年吃掉 30% 以上的货值」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位持有成本与报表\">单位持有成本与报表</h2><h3 id=\"单位持有成本公式\">单位持有成本公式</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HoldingCost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>ins</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>shr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>dep</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>365</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HoldingCost}(u, t) = C_u \\times \\left( r_{\\text{cap}} + r_{\\text{ins}} + r_{\\text{shr}} + r_{\\text{dep}}(u) \\right) \\times \\frac{t}{365} + S(u,t) + L(u,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HoldingCost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ins</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9781em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">365</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单位落地成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是持有天数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是按体积计的仓储费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是按作业计的人工费。前三者与商品形态无关，后两者与形态强相关——这个拆分决定了「清仓该清体积大的还是清金额高的」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"资金占用报表\">资金占用报表</h3><p>资金占用报表要回答三个问题：<strong>压了多少钱、压了多久、这些钱本可以干什么</strong>。第一问是库存金额，第二问是库龄加权金额（加权平均持有天数），第三问是金额 × 费率 × 天数的累计值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH pos AS (&#10;  SELECT p.sku_id, p.warehouse_id, p.qty, p.unit_cost_landed,&#10;         DATE_DIFF(&#39;day&#39;, b.first_received_at, CURRENT_DATE) AS age_days&#10;  FROM fact_inventory_position p&#10;  JOIN dim_location l ON l.location_id = p.location_id&#10;  JOIN LATERAL (&#10;    SELECT MIN(received_at) AS first_received_at&#10;    FROM inv_batch b&#10;    WHERE b.sku_id = p.sku_id AND b.warehouse_id = p.warehouse_id&#10;      AND b.qty_received - b.qty_consumed &gt; 0&#10;  ) b ON TRUE&#10;  WHERE p.snapshot_date = CURRENT_DATE&#10;    AND l.counting_for_capital = TRUE&#10;    AND p.ownership = &#39;OWNED&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT warehouse_id,&#10;       SUM(qty * unit_cost_landed)                        AS capital_tied,&#10;       SUM(qty * unit_cost_landed * age_days) / NULLIF(SUM(qty * unit_cost_landed), 0)&#10;                                                          AS wavg_age_days,&#10;       SUM(qty * unit_cost_landed * age_days / 365.0 * 0.09) AS capital_cost_ytd,&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN age_days &gt; 180 THEN qty * unit_cost_landed ELSE 0 END)&#10;                                                          AS capital_over_180d&#10;FROM pos&#10;GROUP BY warehouse_id&#10;ORDER BY capital_over_180d DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">warehouse_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_cost_landed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         DATE_DIFF(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first_received_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, CURRENT_DATE) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fact_inventory_position p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dim_location l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">location_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">location_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LATERAL (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(received_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_received_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inv_batch b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">warehouse_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">warehouse_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty_received</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty_consumed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">snapshot_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">counting_for_capital</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ownership</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OWNED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost_landed)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capital_tied,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost_landed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_days) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost_landed), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                          AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wavg_age_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost_landed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 365</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">09</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capital_cost_ytd,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 180</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_cost_landed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                          AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capital_over_180d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capital_over_180d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>wavg_age_days</code> 是这张报表里最有解释力的一列：金额加权平均持有天数。它比 DIO 更稳健，因为它不受近期出库波动影响，是纯粹的<strong>存量年龄剖面</strong>。当 <code>wavg_age_days</code> 上升而 DIO 平稳时，说明老库存正在被新库存「稀释」而没有被清掉——这是典型的隐性恶化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与拨备-归因的衔接\">与拨备、归因的衔接</h2><h3 id=\"资金占用是拨备的量化基础\">资金占用是拨备的量化基础</h3><p><a href=\"inventory-provision-finance-link\">存货跌价拨备</a> 的计提需要「预计可变现净值」与「账面成本」两个输入，而持有成本是判断「继续持有是否划算」的关键：当某 SKU 的预计再持有 6 个月成本（约货值 15%）已经超过立即降价清仓的折让（约 10%）时，清仓在财务上就是正收益。这条判断把持有成本从「财务科目」变成了<strong>清仓决策的经济学依据</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归因的落点\">归因的落点</h3><p>资金占用上升必然要归因。按 <a href=\"slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">滞销归因</a> 的四条线（选品/定价/预测/季节）拆解后，资金成本是<strong>给四条线排序的度量</strong>：哪条线造成的资金占用增量最大，就先改哪条。没有资金成本做度量，归因结论会停留在「都有责任」的和稀泥状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨境特有-汇兑与关税的资金成本\">跨境特有：汇兑与关税的资金成本</h3><p>跨境库存的资金成本有两条国内没有的支线：<strong>汇兑敞口</strong>（以美元采购、以欧元销售，持有期内汇率波动直接改变可变现净值）与<strong>关税预缴</strong>（部分国家要求进口时预缴增值税，这笔钱从清关到退税的几个月里是纯占用）。这两项都应按国家维度单列，不能混进通用资本成本率——它们的规模随政策变化，混进去会让费率每年都要重调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>持有成本 = 资本成本 + 仓储 + 服务 + 风险，经验区间为货值的 20%–30%/年，不是仓租那几毛钱。</li>\n<li>资本成本必须用 WACC/机会成本，跨境还要叠加汇兑敞口与关税预缴占用。</li>\n<li>分摊基数要分类：资本按金额、仓储按体积、人工按作业量，单基数会系统性误导。</li>\n<li>费率做到品类级、区域级即可，但 <code>aging_multiplier</code> 要显式表达「越久越贵」。</li>\n<li>金额加权平均持有天数 <code>wavg_age_days</code> 是比 DIO 更稳健的存量恶化指标。</li>\n<li>持有成本是清仓决策的经济学依据，也是 <a href=\"slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">滞销归因</a> 四条线的排序度量。</li>\n<li>持有成本率同时是 EOQ 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 参数来源，低估它会直接制造 <a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/safety-stock-excess-stockout\">超储</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"库存资金占用与持有成本","id":"库存资金占用与持有成本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"持有成本率的测算与分配","id":"持有成本率的测算与分配"},{"level":3,"text":"资本成本不能用账面利率","id":"资本成本不能用账面利率"},{"level":3,"text":"分摊基数的选择","id":"分摊基数的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"费率的粒度","id":"费率的粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"单位持有成本与报表","id":"单位持有成本与报表"},{"level":3,"text":"单位持有成本公式","id":"单位持有成本公式"},{"level":3,"text":"资金占用报表","id":"资金占用报表"},{"level":2,"text":"与拨备、归因的衔接","id":"与拨备-归因的衔接"},{"level":3,"text":"资金占用是拨备的量化基础","id":"资金占用是拨备的量化基础"},{"level":3,"text":"归因的落点","id":"归因的落点"},{"level":3,"text":"跨境特有：汇兑与关税的资金成本","id":"跨境特有-汇兑与关税的资金成本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"在库+在途+多渠道合并视角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/obsolete-excess-detect/onhand-intransit-multichannel-view"},"next":{"title":"滞销归因：选品/定价/预测/季节","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/capital-attribution/slowmove-attribution-selection-price"}}